  "name": "Cryptidkin (Furrykin): Wildframe & Instinct",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC_Character_Options/Cryptidkin_Furrykin_1.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“Your body is built for a world that bites back. So is your patience.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Wildframe.</strong> Add your tier [TODO(pb-call)] to Body check made to resist Stress.</p>\n<p><strong>Keen Sense.</strong> Choose one at character creation: <em>Keen Smell</em>, <em>Keen Hearing</em>, or <em>Keen Sight</em>. You have reroll the lowest die on Soul (Perception (Mind) (Mind) (Mind)) checks [TODO(adv-call)] that rely on that sense.</p>\n<p><strong>Frame Choice.</strong> Choose one narrative frame at character creation; it is permanent.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Predator.</strong> Your unarmed strikes (bite or claws) deal 1d6 instead of 1d4 and count as natural weapons.</li><li><strong>Forager.</strong> You gain a skill rank in the Athletics (Violence) (Violence) (Body) skill. If you already have it, you may choose another skill from the Cryptidkin list (GM adjudicates).</li><li><strong>Brute.</strong> You count as one size larger for the purposes of carrying capacity, push, drag, lift, shove, and grapple.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
